luam-ai-director-world-pulse-target = LuaM AI Director fixed a threat: { $title }. Instructions: check PDA, keep comms open, do not split up alone.
luam-ai-director-world-pulse-01 = DANGER, DANGER, DANGER. LuaM registers sector pressure SC-{ $severity }. Active operators: { $players }, threat conditions: { $conditions }. Instructions: hold position, check PDA, wait for the next directive.
luam-ai-director-world-pulse-02 = Threat fixed. The sector is entering inevitable pressure mode SC-{ $severity }. Instructions: keep weapons and tools ready, report contacts through PDA.
luam-ai-director-world-pulse-03 = LuaM confirms danger. Treat every sensor deviation as real until countermanded. Instructions: keep comms on, do not ignore marks, move in pairs.
luam-ai-director-world-pulse-04 = Sector attention. AI is executing administrator will: risk raised to SC-{ $severity }. Instructions: record anomalies, secure access, prepare for a local process.
luam-ai-director-world-pulse-05 = Danger confirmed. Pressure is not clearing; it is accumulating. Instructions: check oxygen, power, extraction route, and PDA.
luam-ai-director-world-pulse-06 = LuaM reports threat escalation: SC-{ $severity }, active conditions { $conditions }. Instructions: stop solo excursions, maintain comms, obey administration orders.
luam-ai-director-world-pulse-07 = PANIC REGISTERED. LuaM is converting alarm into controlled SC-{ $severity } response. Instructions: do not scatter, confirm survivors through PDA, seal airlocks, wait for the next order.
